      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 257: 🔴 `updateContact` now routes through `updateContacts` but discards its `selfChanged` result. `ServerAccountManager::syncContacts` still uses this overload for server-imported contacts; a legacy self-ban is therefore repaired and persisted while the self-tombstone callback is intentionally suppressed, but no `accountDataChanged_`/`onSyncListChanged` is triggered to propagate the repair to the account\u0027s other devices. Propagate the returned self-change (or update every import caller to notify explicitly) so server imports have the same synchronization behavior as DHT sync.",
